# Ownership dos guardrails. O enforcement de verdade depende de branch protection
# / ruleset no GitHub: este arquivo só declara quem revisa.
#
# Troque `@owner` pelo seu usuário/time. As superfícies abaixo são as que, se
# mudarem sem revisão, desligam o método em silêncio — hooks de agente, regras de
# lint, docs canônicos e a config dos gates.

# Superfícies de enforcement dos agentes (Claude Code · Codex · Cursor · Command Code).
/.github/** @owner
/.agents/** @owner
/.claude/** @owner
/.codex/** @owner
/.cursor/** @owner
/.commandcode/** @owner
/tooling/** @owner

# Documentação canônica dos guardrails.
/AGENTS.md @owner
/CLAUDE.md @owner
/ARCHITECTURE.md @owner
/CODE-PATTERN.md @owner
/MEMORY.md @owner
/VERCEL-OXLINT-MAPPING.md @owner
/guia/** @owner

# Config de pacote, runtime, build e gates.
/package.json @owner
/bun.lock @owner
/bunfig.toml @owner
/lefthook.yml @owner
/.oxlintrc.json @owner
/.oxfmtrc.json @owner
/knip.json @owner
/next.config.ts @owner
/tsconfig*.json @owner
/.env.example @owner
/.gitignore @owner
